VERSION 5.8 ;
DIVIDERCHAR "/" ;
BUSBITCHARS "[]" ;
DESIGN eolsm ;
UNITS DISTANCE MICRONS 1000 ;
DIEAREA ( 0 0 ) ( 8000 5000 ) ;
GCELLGRID X 0 DO 2 STEP 8000 ;
GCELLGRID Y 0 DO 2 STEP 5000 ;
TRACKS Y 50 DO 50 STEP 100 LAYER M1 ;
TRACKS X 50 DO 80 STEP 100 LAYER M2 ;
NETS 14 ;
- a + ROUTED M2 ( 1025 1000 ) ( * 2000 ) ;
- b + ROUTED M2 ( 1025 2085 ) ( * 3000 ) ;
- c + ROUTED M2 ( 2025 1000 ) ( * 2000 ) ;
- d + ROUTED M2 ( 2075 2100 ) ( * 3000 ) ;
- e + ROUTED M2 ( 3025 1000 ) ( * 2000 ) ;
- f + ROUTED M2 ( 3085 2060 ) ( 3500 * ) ;
- g + ROUTED M2 ( 4025 1000 ) ( * 2000 ) NEW M2 ( 3990 1000 ) ( * 1985 ) ;
- h + ROUTED M2 ( 3900 2075 ) ( 4200 * ) ;
- i + ROUTED M2 ( 5025 1000 ) ( * 2000 ) ;
- j + ROUTED M2 ( 5025 2130 ) ( * 3000 ) ;
- k + ROUTED M2 ( 6025 1000 ) ( * 2000 ) ;
- l + ROUTED M2 ( 6025 2129 ) ( * 3000 ) ;
- m + ROUTED M2 ( 7025 1000 ) ( * 2000 ) ;
- n + ROUTED M2 ( 7300 1000 ) ( * 2000 ) ;
END NETS
END DESIGN
